        <calculation class='tableau' formula='//(avg(iif([This month], [% HVA Incentive], null))-&#10;//avg(iif([Previous Month], [% HVA Incentive], null))) * 100&#10;&#10;if month([Parameters].[Reporting Week (copy)_78461151772667907]) &lt;&gt; month(TODAY()-1)&#10;then &#10;((avg(iif([MTD (copy)_3521463102101921795], [monthly_qc_active_customers],0)) / avg(iif([MTD (copy)_3521463102101921795], [monthly_total_active_customer_count],0)))&#10;-&#10;(avg(iif([Previous Month (copy)_78461151781773327], [monthly_qc_active_customers],0)) / avg(iif([Previous Month (copy)_78461151781773327], [monthly_total_active_customer_count],0))))&#10;* 100&#10;ELSEIF &#10;month([Parameters].[Reporting Week (copy)_78461151772667907])  = month(TODAY()-1)&#10;THEN&#10;//((avg(iif([MTD], [monthly_qc_active_customers],0)) / avg(iif([MTD], [monthly_total_active_customer_count],0)))&#10;//-&#10;//(avg(iif([LY MTD], [monthly_qc_active_customers],0)) / avg(iif([LY MTD], [monthly_total_active_customer_count],0))))&#10;//* 100&#10;(([Active Customers MTD (copy 2)_126030480943054851] / [Active Customers MTD growth % (copy) (copy)_132574750947786791])&#10;-&#10;([Active Customers LY MTD (copy)_126030480943329284] / [Active Customers PMTD new (copy)_1397171453351776256]))*100&#10;END' />
